{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-214096","model_call":13,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ stoner stereotypes munchies)"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ stoner stereotypes munchies)"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_56_1359677128#0_2692349311","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q627","rank":1,"snippet":", \"segment\": \"The Top Cannabis Strains That Encourage Weight Loss - Veriheal Lifestyle, Treatment The Top Cannabis Strains That Encourage Weight Loss by Chane Leigh March 9, 2021 09:37 am ET Note: Veriheal does not intend to give this as professional medical advice. Do not attempt to self-diagnose, or prescribe treatment based on the information provided on this page. Always consult a physician before making any decision on the treatment of a medical condition. I know what you’re thinking… how can a plant that is notorious for giving people the <cover>munchies also promote weight loss? Typical “stoner” stereotypes </cover>suggest that smoking marijuana will lead to binge eating and weight gain. Well it’s a little complicated, but yes, it’s possible to lose weight while using marijuana. In fact, medical marijuana is known to help ailments such as anorexia and help increase appetite in cancer patients, but now research shows it can be used to help lose weight. Below, we’ll go over the strains that promote weight loss and introduce the cannabinoid responsible for appetite suppression—THCV. You can use cannabis while losing weight through the appetite suppressant cannabinoid THCV or through using "},"time":51},"model_calls":13,"document_judgments":5,"relevance_3":3,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
