{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-214096","model_call":19,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ weed tired hungry why)"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ weed tired hungry why)"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_1500593827#4_3321381038","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q630","rank":1,"snippet":"behind the Munchies Are there Medical Advantages to this? Why does smoking weed make you hungry? Final thoughts About The Author \" , \"segment\": \"This is actually what Rick Simpson said when asked about the efficacy of cannabis in curing cancer. He said, one of the two things needed in the recovery process is eating and rest, cannabis does both of these [paraphrased]. Medical patients can attest to these two side-effects. When you smoke or vape cannabis. You’ll notice immediately that aside from the feeling of “high”, you feel also <cover>tired or hungry. Why does smoking weed </cover>make you hungry? Essentially, weed makes you hungry because the cannabinoids within cannabis mimic the cannabinoids in your body and trick the hormones (ghrelin) responsible for hunger to go into production. As of now, we know that THC is the main catalyst in the equation (as it binds with the CB1 /glucose receptors along with anandamide) and eventually stimulating the hypothalamus in our brain to give us the sense of hunger — hence, the cravings for food. That being said, more studies need to be conducted to understand how other cannabinoids might play a role in the mechanics. "},"time":82},"model_calls":19,"document_judgments":9,"relevance_3":4,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
