{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-214096","model_call":26,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ marijuana munchies olfactory bulb thc)"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ marijuana munchies olfactory bulb thc)"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_12_1031735178#7_2030946474","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q635","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_12_1031735178#7_2030946474\" , \"end_char\": 4405.000000 , \"headings\": \"Does Smoking Weed Cause Acne? Does Smoking Weed Cause Acne? Does Smoking Weed Cause Acne? The THC-Testosterone Link Collagen Nutritional Deficiencies Suppressed Immune System Tips to Prevent Acne for <cover>Marijuana Users: \" , \"segment\": \"That’s not really because of the cravings themselves, but rather the types of foods that most people eat to satisfy those cravings. THC fires up the olfactory bulb in your brain, and this makes food smell and taste better. Pair that with the human body’s natural attraction to fats and sweets and it’s very easy to want to quell your munchies </cover>with foods that lead to clogged pores. If you’re the type who’s all about gorging yourself on high-fat foods and sweets when you’re high, then you shouldn’t be too surprised if you develop acne. Tips to Prevent Acne for Marijuana Users: Drink plenty of water Use a moisturizer Take vitamin D supplements and probiotics – probiotics help improve immune system function Choose "},"time":80},"model_calls":26,"document_judgments":15,"relevance_3":7,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
