{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-214096","model_call":45,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ thc ghrelin appetite cannabis)"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ thc ghrelin appetite cannabis)"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_141634017#7_333406873","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q648","rank":1,"snippet":"Appetite? Conclusion \" , \"segment\": \"Cannabis contains THC which acts on the CB1 receptors. The CB1 receptors are involved in the activation of the olfactory mechanism which makes one more responsive to external stimuli like the smell of food, freshly baked cake and the taste of some fruit juice. Must Read: 6 Best CBD Oils for Treating PTSD: Dosage, Scientific Studies, and Success Stories The stimuli are taken to the olfactory cortex which is connected to the appetite center in the hypothalamus and thus in this way <cover>cannabis or more specifically THC improves appetite. THC is also responsible for releasing the hormone known as ghrelin </cover>that is known to induce appetite. Thus, undergoing chemotherapy actively use cannabis to increase their appetite. What Do Research Studies Say About CBD for Appetite? Research says that CBD is an important substance for alleviating stress and anxiety. Studies indicate that when a person is stressed, he’s more likely to lose appetite.\" , \"start_char\": 2534.000000 , \"title\": \"CBD For Appetite: Does CBD Make You Hungry? | Redstorm Scientific\" , \"url\": \"https://www.redstormscientific.com/"},"time":128},"model_calls":45,"document_judgments":28,"relevance_3":12,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
