{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-214096","model_call":49,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"why does marijuana make you tired\")"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"why does marijuana make you tired\")"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_253845474#0_615401161","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q651","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_253845474#0_615401161\" , \"end_char\": 1048.000000 , \"headings\": \"Drowsiness Drowsiness<cover>Why Does Marijuana Make You Tired</cover>About Medical Marijuana Side Effects How Does Cannabis Make You Sleepy? Which Kinds of Cannabis Medicine Can Make Me Tired? Managing Marijuana-Related Drowsiness Learn About Cannabis’ Perks Doctors Near You Dispensaries Near You Helpful Resources \" , \"segment\": \"Drowsiness from Cannabis | Medical Marijuana Side Effects Drowsiness Updated on January 25, 2019. Medical content reviewed by Dr. Joseph Rosado, MD, M.B.A, Chief Medical Officer Why Does Marijuana Make You Tired As a medical marijuana patient, you may deal with frequent drowsiness due to your medication. Or, perhaps you want to try cannabis medicine, but you worry it will make you too tired to function. Either way, you want to know everything you can about cannabis and tiredness so you can medicate yourself in the best way possible. While marijuana can cause drowsiness, there are of ways to manage it. We’ll give you the low-down. About Medical Marijuana Side Effects Just like any other ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_253845474#0_615401161","rank":1,"relevance":3}]},"time":114},"model_calls":49,"document_judgments":30,"relevance_3":12,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
